          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 90:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 90,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Who knoweth the power of thine anger? even according to thy fear, so is thy wrath.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 71
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 90:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 90,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "So teach us to number our days, that we may apply our hearts unto wisdom.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 11
          },
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 53
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 90:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 90,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Return, O Lord, how long? and let it repent thee concerning thy servants.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "HEB have pity on Thy servants."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
